  "prov:wasGeneratedBy": "Simulated tiers are generated by the repository scripts for analytical Z^gamma projections, binary-alloy particle construction, 4D dynamics, dose-controlled projections, and abTEM multislice simulations. Real tiers are converted from public Zenodo microscopy/reconstruction records into the repository's common NAF pickle format with manifests and per-sample metadata. Benchmark results are produced by scripts/run_benchmark.py and audited with scripts/validate_results.py.",
